WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I should have left that
backstage.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:03.470 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, everybody.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was at the doctor
the other day and he told me,

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Joe, if you don't start
eating right and exercising,

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna have to put you
on medication."

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"Just give me the medication.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.084
I'm not gonna do that now that I
know about the medication.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
You shouldn't have told me
about the medication."

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.323 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.157 size:84% position:42% line:92%
By now you're realizing

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:26.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have a higher-pitched voice
than most men.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:30.130
That's a burden that Mike Tyson
and I share together.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went to
a fast-food drive-through.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:35.702
The person on the other end of
the microphone heard my voice

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.669 line:92%
and thought I was female.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pulled around
to pick up my Baconator,

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.840 line:92%
and he still called me ma'am.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.875 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.277 line:92%
And I didn't even correct him.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.045 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I figured what's worse?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
A stranger thinking I'm female
when I'm male

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
or having to persuade...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
...another man
that I'm also a man.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:54.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
I won't do it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:58.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've had that conversation
too many times.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
And too many times
they were not persuaded.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:03.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
I told a female friend that,
and she said,

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, what do you think
is worse?

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.667
A person thinking you're
a female when you're male

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.835 line:92%
or pregnant when you're not?"

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said, "Well, both have
happened to me."

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.607 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Neither made me feel
very good."

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:17.610 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.678 line:92%
But did remind me of a story

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:21.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I went to Disney World
a couple years back.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.150 size:78% position:39%
There's a thing there
called the Fast Pass.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's where you can pay more
to cut in line,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.988
but what they don't tell you is
when you cut at amusement parks

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:33.526
it's overwhelmingly children
that you're cutting in front of.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.127 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:36.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I bought one.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
Went to the roller coaster,
used my Fast Pass,

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.934 line:92%
and realized I enjoy the cutting

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
way more than
any of the stupid rides.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.338 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.506 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It got to the point

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:48.274 size:81% position:41%
I wouldn't even bother
getting on the rides.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would just go to
the front of the line

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:54.280
and then loop back around to cut
in front of more children.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:56.382 line:92%
At one point a child said,

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:57.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Daddy, why can he go
in front of us?"

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said, "I make more money
than your father does."

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:04.157 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.693
He said, "Daddy, that's
the meanest pregnant lady

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:10.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've ever seen."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.666
I read that the Drug Enforcement
Agency is gonna crack down hard

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:17.704
on NFL doctors over painkillers
and performance-enhancing drugs.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:19.139 line:92%
I don't think they should.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:20.573 line:92%
I would take steroids on purpose

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
just so I don't have to play
football.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:23.743 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:26.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because steroids
are safer than football.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:26.813 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.048
Doctor's like, "Joe, you tested
positive for steroids.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:32.252
That means you're not allowed to
be tackled over and over again

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:37.924 size:88% position:44%
by a 6'4", 300-pound man
who's also on steroids."

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:38.825 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Well, gee, Doc,
that sounds bad.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.362 line:92%
What are the steroids gonna do?"

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.230
He's like, "well, they're gonna
give you

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
a deeper voice
and smaller testicles."

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.768 size:81% position:41%
I'm like, "I could use
both of those things."

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.303 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:52.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Scratch me
right where I itch, Doc."

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:58.745 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:01.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do a lot of traveling
for stand-up.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.782 line:92%
On a recent flight though,

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lady had her dog
in the middle seat,

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:07.787
and she bragged to me that she
bought a fake service dog vest

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:08.321 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
on the Internet.

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now she takes her dog
everywhere,

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:12.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I thought
that was a little off-putting.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:12.959 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And she explained to me

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
that technically her dog
cheers her up,

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
so in a way it is
an emotional-support dog.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:20.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought, "Yeah, but what dog
doesn't cheer you up?"

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
If your dog
doesn't cheer you up,

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.904 size:84% position:42%
you should check to see
if your dog is a cat.

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:26.539 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:28.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because cats
are the number-one reason

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
you would need
an emotional-support dog.

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:31.311 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:33.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
They call those ladies
crazy cat ladies,

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:33.746 size:81% position:41% line:92%
but they weren't crazy

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:36.950
before they had a whole bunch of
pets that didn't love them back.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.453 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:43.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got a weird call
from my bank, gang.

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:46.326
They said that my security
questions were hacked again,

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:49.329
and they recommended that I
change the answers immediately.

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:50.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
I replied,
"Well, how does that work?

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:57.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
How can I change the answers
to facts about myself?"

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.071 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:01.975
What's your favorite band?
Led Zeppelin. Not anymore.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:02.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now it's the Backstreet Boys.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:08.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
My security questions
have been hacked so many times

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:09.949 line:92%
I have my regular personality

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
and an alter-ego
I had to write down

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:16.956
so I could remember what I said
was true about myself.

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:17.690 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.324 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
In my regular life

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:20.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
I enjoy Sprite
and "Battlestar Galactica."

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:24.063
Ask the Internet,
it's cocaine and cage fighting.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:28.635 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:28.635 --> 00:04:29.636 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:32.438 size:81% position:41%
-Joe Machi, everybody.
Hey, nice to see you.

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
You should have left that
backstage.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:39.045 line:92%
Follow him on Twitter @Joemachi.

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:42.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
My thanks to Jason Momoa,
J.K. Simmons,

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:45.018 size:84% position:42%
Joe Machi once again.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:47.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was great.
You deserve it, buddy.

